          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USathane eseqedile ukulinga konke wasuka kuye okwesikhathi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wabuyela eGalili ngamandla kaMoya; lodumo lwakhe lwanda kulo lonke ilizwe lakhona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafundisa emasinagogeni abo edunyiswa yibo bonke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafika eNazaretha, lapho akhulela khona, njengokwejwayela kwakhe wangena esinagogeni ngosuku lweSabatha; wasukuma ukuba abale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanikwa ugwalo lomprofethi ulsaya, waluvula, wafumana indawo okulotshwe kuyo ukuthi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walugoqa ugwalo, walubuyisela encekwini, wahlala phansi; amehlo abo bonke ababesesinagogeni amjolozela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waqala ukukhuluma kibo esithi: Lamuhla lumbhalo ugcwalisekile endlebeni zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke bamncoma bemangala ngamazwi omusa aphuma emlonyeni wakhe. Bathi: Lo kasiyo indodana kaJosefa na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kibo: Impela lizakutsho kimi lesisaga lithi: Nyanga, zelaphe wena. Lokho esikuzwileyo ukwenza eKapenawume, kwenze lalapha elizweni lakini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathike: Ngiqinisile ngithi kini: Kakho umprofethi owamukelekayo elizweni lakibo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.4.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joha 4:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ngeqiniso ngithi kini: Kwakukhona koIsrayeli abafelwakazi abanengi ensukwini zikaElija, lapho izulu lalivalekile iminyaka emithathu lenyanga eziyisithupha, kwaba khona indlala enkulu elizweni lonke;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.17.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kho 17:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa uElija kathunyelwanga lakoyedwa wabo, kuphela eSarepita elizweni laseSidoni kowesifazana ongumfelwakazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.17.8+1KI.17.9+1KI.17.10+1KI.17.11+1KI.17.12+1KI.17.13+1KI.17.14+1KI.17.15+1KI.17.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kho 17:8–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakukhona futhi koIsrayeli abalobulephero abanengi ngesikhathi sikaElisha umprofethi; kodwa kakuhlanjululwanga lamunye wabo, kuphela uNamani umSiriya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
